{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"hello"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"更新遅れてすみません"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/10/0919073/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/10/0919073/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/10/0919073/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントいつも本当にあ\nりがとうございます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"勉強の合間に読んだりしてパワーもらってます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい。まぁだから最近はドタバタとしてました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/10/0919073/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"期末テストも月曜から始まって大変です。。。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/10/0919073/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/10/0919073/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日曜日は全国握手会がありました〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/10/0919073/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/10/0919073/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/10/0919073/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"７thのシングル曲全部披露しました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/10/0919073/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/10/0919073/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歌ってるとき、会場いっぱいに人が居てサイリウムもすごく綺麗でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/10/0919073/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リハーサルの時 、会場広すぎて、\nたくさんお客さんが来てくれるか心配でした。\nでもステージにたった瞬間！\n心配なんて吹っ飛んでました\n午前はライブ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/10/0919073/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"午後から夕方まで握手会"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/10/0919073/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会終わって、お渡し会"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/10/0919073/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても充実した１日になりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/10/0919073/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/10/0919073/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/10/0919073/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の握手会のペア〜メンバーは生田えりかちゃん&齋藤飛鳥ちゃん&まあやでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/10/0919073/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/10/0919073/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いくちゃんファンの皆様と飛鳥ファンの皆様優しく楽しくしてくださって\nありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/10/0919073/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/10/0919073/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"又逢いたいです(#^.^#)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやファンの皆様へ\nいつも心強いんです。\n来てくれてありがとう(#^.^#)\n顔を見たらホッとしちゃいます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/10/0919073/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に皆様寒い中、長いレーンも並んでくれて、会いに来てくれて本当に本当にありがとうございましたm(__)m皆並び疲れてましたね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/10/0919073/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少しでも会いに来てくれた方もいて嬉しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/10/0919073/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来れなくてもコメントでの応援も勇気とパワーになってるんです！\nありがとうございます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/10/0919073/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お渡し会のペアーは抽選で決めたんですけど、橋本ななみちゃんとでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/10/0919073/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ショートカットチームでしたw\nよくこの二人似てるといってくださる方が多いので嬉しいですっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/10/0919073/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/10/0919073/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/10/0919073/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん！この飛鳥の服を見てどう思いますか？このプリントされてる人！誰だと思いますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近こういう服ばっかり来てるなぁ。系統がかわりましたねぇ。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/10/0919073/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"w"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/10/0919073/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいたん！happybirthday(*´ω｀*)\nちなみにまあやのお母さんと同じ誕生日なのっ♪\n(いらない情報w)\nいつもご飯とかお買い物誘ってくれて有り難う"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/10/0919073/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/10/0919073/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見た目とは想像できないくらい？優しいよね？♪ぇw\n本当におめでとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/10/0919073/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゅんなちゃん遅くなってしまったけど、おめでとう♪\n素敵な１年になりますように♪\nいつも声かけてくれて有り難う♪\n今はわかんないけどまあやとのツーショットも待受画面にしてくれてありがとねぇ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/10/0919073/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/10/0919073/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/10/0919073/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国の12月生まれの方もおめでとう〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/10/0919073/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/10/0919073/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会で本当に沢山沢山お話しできて、パワー沢山沢山貰ったので今週も頑張れます\n皆一緒に頑張ろう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/10/0919073/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/10/0919073/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に本当に、皆さんのことがもっともっと好きになりました\nありがとうっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/10/0919073/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/12/10/0919073/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは引き続き勉強頑張ります♪\n応援コメント待ってるね？笑笑笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Bye"}],"source":"archive"}